---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
{#-
  Two-column layout with TopicNav on the left (HANDOFF §5, §6.2, §6.4;
  boards Problem-A.dc.html and Intro-B.dc.html). Below 600px the sidebar is
  hidden and TopicNav is reached through the Menu panel instead.

  Without a band (problem pages), <main> is the right-hand column, so the
  skip link jumps past TopicNav. With a band (Start here), <main> wraps the
  band and both columns, so the H1 stays inside it.

  Front matter (plus everything base.njk reads):
    band      "standard" to show the title band above both columns
    chapters  [{ title }] chapter links under "Introduction videos"
              (Start here only), linked as #v1, #v2, ...
    area      the current problem's area_id (problem pages): opens it
-#}
{%- from "partials/topic-nav.njk" import topicNav -%}
{%- set topicAreas = collections.problems | groupByArea(areas) -%}
{%- if band and band != 'none' %}
<main id="main">
  {% include "partials/title-band.njk" %}
  <div class="with-sidebar with-sidebar--roomy container">
    <div class="with-sidebar__side">
      {{ topicNav(topicAreas, page_id, area, chapters, 's-', page.url) }}
    </div>
    <div class="with-sidebar__main">
      {{ content | safe }}
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
{%- else %}
<div class="with-sidebar container">
  <div class="with-sidebar__side">
    {{ topicNav(topicAreas, page_id, area, chapters, 's-', page.url) }}
  </div>
  <main id="main" class="with-sidebar__main">
    {{ content | safe }}
  </main>
</div>
{%- endif %}
